WEBVTT

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:03.940
There's no mistaking it.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:08.440
I saw a <i>tsuchinoko</i> in that grove!

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.870
I saw it... I saw...

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.910
Mr. Bimii as a fearsome monster...!

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:27.550
Um... I saw it flying,
above the old school grounds, last night.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.130
That was definitely a UFO...

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.970
Why am I doing something like this?

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.260
Yes, I found out...

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:42.020
...about Person A and Person B from a certain
club getting into a messy fight over Person C...

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:46.900
Cryptids, UFOs, and club scandals...

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:51.240
Recently, there has been so much happening
that we never run out of news to print.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.700
As part of the newspaper club,
I'm glad there is a lot of news.

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:56.620
But...

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.040
Is this a coincidence?

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:40.050
Yuto, please, let me hear it from your lips.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:45.270
That your heart belongs only to me.
It's true, isn't it, Yuto?

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.520
Nyamirin...

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:49.600
Get away from Yuto, rowr!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.860
Kumano...? What's going on?

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:55.440
Yuto's heart is already far away from you, rowr!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.780
That's not possible. Yuto said it himself—

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:02.200
"I like bouncy-bouncies more than anything!"

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.790
That's in the past, rowr!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.040
It's hard to appreciate bouncy-bouncies
if he gets them every day, rowr!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.250
He said, "I can't get enough of how
a perfect handful feels after all," rowr!

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.170
No way!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:19.930
He was sparkling when he said, "Let's take
a spacewalk with your bouncy-bouncies tonight"!

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.970
It's different now, rowr!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.810
"The perfect handful makes me feel safe.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.480
A day trip to the hot springs is better than a spacewalk."

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.310
That's what he always says by my pillow.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.860
Yuto, which is it?!

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:36.070
Tell it to us straight, rowr!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:41.240
Sorry, I cannot choose just one.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:47.290
I love both bouncy-bouncies
and perfect handfuls!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.920
Both spacewalks and hot springs day trips.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:55.710
I... I... Oh, jeez! What is up with this script?!

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.210
Cut! Cut!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.170
What good is a shy actor?

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:02.720
When you get on stage, you need to
abandon your shyness and embarrassment!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.220
You have to bare all!

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:09.060
Why do we have to act like this anyway?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.020
I explained, didn't I?

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:16.360
Right now, Otone and I are
looking for members for our new club!

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.490
First, we send fake news and scandals
to the newspaper club

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:27.370
and then <i>casually</i> show our "Club Members
Wanted" signs when they cover the news.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.250
Then, the people reading
those articles will unknowingly think:

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.080
"Oh, maybe I'll try joining this new club!"

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.040
Don't you think that could happen?

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.920
I see! It's like a "supplement effect," huh?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.920
A <i>subliminal</i> effect, ryui.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:44.930
We need to keep practicing so the
newspaper club can come at any time!

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:50.770
Anyway, people who see this
won't think it's acting, will they?

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:56.690
Wouldn't that mean people would think
I'm really two-timing then?

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:02.280
Yes. You would definitely be called
the worst, most horrible two-timing bastard.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.160
Damn, you didn't have to say that.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.570
I quit!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:10.410
It can't be helped. Then, why don't
you trade roles with Tonkyun?

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.790
Here, wear this!

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.080
Huh? What is <i>this</i>?

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.090
Wait, that was supposed to be my part?

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.420
Yup, yup!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:23.220
I have a thing or two to say
about the script, too, rowr!

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:26.590
I don't know about the phrase
"perfect handful," rowr!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:31.930
Despite how I look, I have enough for a
one-night, two-day vacation prize package!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.600
I'm having fun with this.

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:40.940
Ichinomiya, do you really think
you'll get members by doing this?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.320
I still haven't gotten any...

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.780
What about you, Otone?

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.160
Um... There's still nobody... Nothing.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.250
Anyway, have you even decided
what kind of club it will be?

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.460
I came up with a bunch of different ideas,
but none of them really seemed to fit.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.880
Rather than focusing on getting members,

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:03.010
shouldn't you decide what
you're going to do as a club first?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.630
No, we haven't shifted from the basic concept

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:11.970
of surrounding Eruna Ichinomiya
with cute girls, so I think we're fine!

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:15.770
No, I think you can shift away
from that more, ryui...

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:19.650
If it's come to this, we'll have to get
someone to be in two clubs at once...

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:22.480
Nyamirin, Kumano!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.570
Hmm, we have our own activities here, though...

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.530
Being in two clubs is actually very hard, rowr!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:32.620
I want to give my undivided
attention to the drama club, so I can't.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:37.000
Akama, even Usamaru is better than
nothing! Won't you share him with me?

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:41.130
Wait a minute!
Why am I "better than nothing"?!

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.000
Oh, Usamaru might be okay.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.550
If it's Usamaru, it might be fine.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:45.970
No, no, no, no, no, no!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:51.260
I'm devoting all of myself
to this drama club, too, so I can't!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.440
Well, there's no use trying to hurry things.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:58.980
Let's look for someone patiently.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.770
You can't do that, ryui.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:01.770
Why not?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:07.610
You can only apply to start a new club
until the midterm battles, ryui.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.780
Not the "midterm exams"?

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:15.200
The midterm battles are
club battles to test ability, ryui.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:19.210
They're like midterm exams
at normal schools, ryui.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:25.170
Oh? What'll happen if we can't find
new members before the midterm battles?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:29.760
Unfortunately, you'll have no choice
but to give up on creating a new club.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:33.720
What? Then we have to hurry up
and find one more person somehow!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.930
I'll take anyone! Won't someone please join?!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.020
You'll take anyone, ryui?

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.190
What do you mean by that?

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.190
Well, if you say you'll take anyone...

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:47.740
...I might have someone in mind... ryui...

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.110
Really? Who? Who?

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.120
I-I can't breathe, ryui!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.780
I can't tell you right now, ryui!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.620
This is just a last resort, ryui!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.920
Anyway, let's find someone
as soon as possible, ryui!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:05.300
Even if you say that,
there isn't anyone else I can ask...

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.810
It looks like that eejit found
someone to join her new club.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:19.730
Otone Fujishiro, I believe...?

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:24.610
I didn't think there was a
student who would join that idiot.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.490
Once they find another member,
their club will be recognized,

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.700
and she'll be able to graduate
from that sleeping bag.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:35.160
It's a little sad to think that
she'll leave this mansion, huh?

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:40.370
It's fine, isn't it? It'll be quieter.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:44.830
Is that how you feel? I thought for
sure that you would be sad, my lady.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.090
Are you finished?

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.510
I'm going to lie down.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.020
Seisa!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:12.650
I finally found someone to join my new club!

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.700
Really? That's nice.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:18.490
But you need three members
to apply to form a club, right?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:23.370
That's right! I need to find one more
person somehow before the midterm battles!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.870
I hope you find someone.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.920
Yes, I'll try my best!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:34.430
Super-perfect-okay!

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:35.930
U-Um...

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:38.760
I'm so moved! I believed in you!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.850
Ever since I heard that you
were making a new club,

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:45.020
I knew that you would come to me eventually!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.480
Um...

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.730
Have you decided on a name for your new club?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.230
No, not yet...

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.240
Then, I've got one.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.530
We can call it the "Building Shigure Ninomiya
and Eruna Ichinomiya's Love Pyramid

00:09:55.740 --> 00:10:00.030
Where They Do Nothing but Smooch Club."

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.200
It's decided!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.080
Shigure and Eruna's Love Club, ooh!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:08.130
Where every day, the two rendezvous!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.710
Shigure and Eruna's Love Club, ooh!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.050
How are you? Comment allez-vous?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:17.180
The magical spell is "Bippity Boppity Boo"!

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:20.390
Three little piggies go, "oink, oink," to you!

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.390
Um, Ninomiya...

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.390
Huh?

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.390
She's not here anymore...

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.650
What?

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:30.730
It's no good, after all. I can't deal with that.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:35.070
I was an idiot for thinking for
even a second to ask Shigure...

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.740
Oh, then you're meeting up
with Fujishiro, too?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:42.160
Yeah! I wonder what kind
of club her new club is.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.620
I can't wait to find out!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.420
Could those girls be
potential new club members?!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:55.550
Um, you're Otone Fujishiro... right...?

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:04.390
We heard that you and Ichinomiya were
making a new club. Can you tell us more...?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:07.100
There's nothing to talk about.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:07.770
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:08.980
Huh?!

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.860
Anticomplex!

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:13.070
Snake!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.450
Wh-What...?

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:20.740
If you beat me here, I'll let you join.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.780
In other words, it's an admission test!

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.120
A test?

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.750
Don't tell me you think that

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.960
just because it's this time of the year,
we'll welcome anyone who shows interest,

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:31.460
that we accept applications year-round,

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:37.590
and that we don't turn anyone away,
accepting everyone, no questions asked, do you?

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.130
N-No way...

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:43.050
There's no way we can beat the winner
of the rookie battle, Otone Fujishiro...

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.930
Otone...

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.530
Now, whom shall we start with?

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:02.570
Um...

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.410
I'm not interested anymore...

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.790
- Sorry for bothering you!
- Sorry for bothering you!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.000
Otone!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.630
That was nice!
The explosive Black Otone style!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:23.090
I loved it! But for Otone beginners like
those girls, it might've been a little too much.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.060
Wai—Otone...?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.690
Otone!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.440
Why are you running away?

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.900
You saw, didn't you?

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.280
Huh?

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:42.570
The two of us worked so hard
to publicize our club,

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:47.200
and we finally found girls who might join,

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.330
but Fujishiro drove them away!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:53.880
No, no, but you're going to go after them
and turn into the usual White Otone,

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.290
and apologize, saying "Just kidding!" right?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:58.210
And say, "Tee-hee," right?

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.630
I'm not doing that.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:00.720
What?

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.380
I sent them away for real.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.800
There you go again.
It's an American joke, right?

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.720
It's not a joke!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:08.970
What...?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:15.100
I know we won't be able to form our club
if we don't find another member soon...

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:22.360
Even so... Even so, Fujishiro sent away
prospective members with all her strength!

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:24.320
Really...?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.570
Yeah...

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.330
Why...?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:33.250
Because right now,
Fujishiro only has Eruna, that's why.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:39.380
If someone else comes between us,
you'll be further away from me...

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:40.920
That's not true!

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:44.970
Even if we get a new club member,
our relationship will stay the same!

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:47.640
No, it won't! You don't understand, Eruna!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:52.850
Otone?

00:13:54.600 --> 00:14:01.480
I finally made a precious friend. If someone
else showed up, and she became distant...

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:06.320
Thinking about that makes me so uneasy,
I don't know what to do... I don't like it...

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:09.490
You have a lot of friends, Eruna!
You can't understand!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.000
Then, are you saying that
there were other girls, too...?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:19.880
I'm sorry! I knew that it was wrong,
but even so... Fujishiro didn't want... Eruna...

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.460
Thanks.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.590
Huh?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.300
You're the first person to say that to me, Otone!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.390
It makes me really happy!

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:30.850
Eruna...

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.140
All right, I've decided!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.520
The name of the new club will be...

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:40.860
Ta-da! The "Otone Fawning Over
Eruna Ichinomiya Club"!

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:45.950
Huh? But won't it be bad if we
don't get another club member?

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:51.870
If it makes you sad,
then I don't need any other members!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.040
It'll be me and you, just the two of us...

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:00.840
Wai—I don't really like that...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.920
I mean, it's gross!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.180
Ow...

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:10.720
Are you okay, Otone?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.680
Uh, yes...

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.230
What's this room...?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:26.030
I wonder if it used to be used as a classroom?

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:34.660
Imagine if we gathered at a place
like this after classes ended,

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:38.210
bringing snacks and making noise...
That might be fun!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:41.250
Then Fujishiro will bring a tea set!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.300
Maybe I'll sit around here!

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:49.630
Then Fujishiro will sit here.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.260
And over there...

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.850
...will be where the new club members sit, right?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.390
Otone, I'm sure we're thinking the same thing.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.650
Yes, let's make this room...

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.150
...our clubroom!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.820
Unfortunately, that is impossible.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.860
Rumina from the newspaper club?!

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.240
What do you mean, "impossible"?

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:19.410
It has already been decided that
the newspaper club will use this room.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:20.210
What?!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:21.920
No...

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:24.630
The newspaper club
already has a room, doesn't it?

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:27.760
So you should let us use this room!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:33.010
Our current room is too crowded,
so we were looking for a new room.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.760
So please give up on this room.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.430
I won't give it up!
I'm gonna put my spit on it first!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.850
Ptui, ptui! Ptui, ptui!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.020
Then, how about this?

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.230
Let's decide with a practice match.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:57.540
Eruna, that person's fighting style
and strength are unknown.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.200
Fujishiro will...

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:05.040
Don't worry, Otone! If it's to get
our clubroom, I definitely won't lose!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:10.630
Oh my, I thought the winner of the rookie battle,
Otone Fujishiro, would be the one to fight.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.970
But no matter who it is,
you're no match for me.

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.390
Begin the match.

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.560
Coming for my crystals all at once, huh?

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:23.520
But unfortunately, you will not reach my crystals.

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.060
That's Rumina's...

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.030
...item to activate her ability?

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:35.700
Shocking fact! The summer she was four,
Eruna Ichinomiya wrote as her Tanabata wish,

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:39.990
"I want to be Shigure's wife when I grow up,"
making a bold confession.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.830
Huh? Wh-What's that?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.000
Exclusive scoop! Eruna Ichinomiya, age 6.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:50.380
She tried to make Valentine chocolates for
Shigure Ninomiya but failed spectacularly.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:54.840
But Shigure Ninomiya said,
"They're shaped funny but taste really good!"

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:55.840
And she was involuntarily moved to tears!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:59.350
Wait a minute! What's that?!
Why do you know all that?!

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.850
If you have the information network
of the newspaper club,

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.730
you can get as much
information like this as you want.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:09.770
What information network?
You got all that from Shigure, didn't you?

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:13.150
What? Does that mean everything
she said just now was true?

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.280
No, wait! Um...

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.700
Special report! Eruna Ichinomiya, age 9.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:21.240
Shigure Ninomiya gave her an
original birthday rap as a present,

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.700
and she was moved to tears.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.870
What kind of space-time
do you need to be lost in

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.460
to be moved to tears by a rap on your birthday?

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:30.380
No! Stop it!

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:33.840
Follow-up report!
For Shigure Ninomiya's birthday that year,

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:37.720
this time Eruna Ichinomiya gave him
an original birthday rap as a present,

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:40.050
and then she moved herself to tears.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:49.310
What? Eruna didn't receive any physical
damage... Why did her crystal break?!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:50.230
Don't tell me—

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:54.610
That's right. When a person's
embarrassment goes past its limit,

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:57.910
the urge to end the match as soon as possible

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:01.950
makes them unconsciously
destroy their own crystals.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:05.580
Do you understand now?

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.960
This is my ability—Secret Memories!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.540
There's still much more to come!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:12.750
Extra edition!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.880
Just stop it already...!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:23.680
Well? Can you still continue?

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:29.310
You should give up before
the wound becomes deeper.

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.940
If you don't...

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:37.950
Otone's ribbons!

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:48.790
Why? How can you stand?

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.710
U-Um...

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:55.170
Scandalous photo! Eruna Ichinomiya,
age 12, with Shigure Ninomiya...

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.550
W-With Shigure Ninomiya...

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.130
Why... Why isn't it working?

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:04.100
Tension max! Go!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:18.070
All right!

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.910
Now this clubroom is ours!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.700
Congratulations!

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:29.710
But I believe you still only
have two people in your club.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:34.500
Ichinomiya, did you think I didn't
know that you were so desperate

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:39.670
you were making up news stories
to find another person to join your club?

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:43.010
You must have at least three members.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.970
If you don't fulfill this condition,
you cannot form a club.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:50.390
If you don't have a club,
you cannot have a clubroom.

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:54.360
I'm sorry, Eruna. There were
people interested in joining, too...

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:56.020
It's fine already, Otone.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:00.440
Well, that's how it is, so the
newspaper club will take this room.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:01.650
Excuse me...

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.910
I want to join Eruna Ichinomiya's club.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.790
Sparkle....

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.160
Um...

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.080
Who're you?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:15.380
That's... I have no information
about a student like him!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.590
Smile...!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.510
Yay...!

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.590
We got permission for the club,
and we have a clubroom!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.850
But boy, am I surprised.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:30.560
I didn't know you could
do a trick like that, Bimii!

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:36.270
It's really hard to turn into that form, ryui...

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.980
I don't want to do it if I don't have to, ryui...

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.690
But now that you're an
official member of the club,

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.240
we'll need you to do it for club battles and stuff.

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:47.240
Give me a break, ryui...

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:50.120
Please find other members soon, ryui...

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.000
By the way, Eruna, what did
you decide to name the club?

00:21:56.130 --> 00:21:57.170
I named it...

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:00.550
Ta-da! The "I'll Figure It out Later Club"!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.300
There's a limit to how long
you can put it off, ryui!

00:23:42.270 --> 00:23:43.360
Quiet down, Usamaru!

00:23:43.570 --> 00:23:44.940
But I saw it!

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:46.570
What, what? What did you see?

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:49.740
Was it Kuzuryu getting up
at 5:00 every morning to milk a cow?

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:50.700
No!

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:53.120
Then was it Mr. Bimii when he goes "pwoosh"?

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:54.030
What are you talking about?

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:57.960
Then it was the slimy part in
the zipper on Miracle Man's back, rowr!

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:59.210
What are you talking about?!

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:01.960
And it <i>really</i> worries me
if his zipper has a slimy part!

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:05.550
Never mind that, Usamaru.
How are things going with Sagara?

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.130
Why did you have to bring up Sagara's name now?!

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:10.680
Ah! Usamaru's blushing, rowr!

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:12.390
You're a surprisingly good pair, aren't you?

00:24:12.590 --> 00:24:14.220
We're not a good pair at all!

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:17.520
Yes, I see. And I get the feeling
you're kind of lonely.

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:18.560
Uh, Tonkyun?!

00:24:18.770 --> 00:24:20.890
Next time, "Sleeping Bag Haunting."

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:24.820
Usamaru and Tonkyun together
inside the same sleeping bag... rowr!

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:29.400
None of that makes any sense!
I'm telling you, I saw it!

00:24:29.610 --> 00:24:30.650
The nameplate on Tonkyun's house?

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:32.240
My house doesn't have one of those.

00:24:32.450 --> 00:24:35.530
So, just what was it that Usamaru saw?!

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:38.540
You'll find out next time! Rowr!
